{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Unhide a diskpart Type=Hidden partition (Id 27) by setting Id=07 Override, then assign a letter in Disk Management.","label":"Hidden Partition","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/firewall","label":"Firewall","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/firewall"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/hide_folder","label":"Hide Folder","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/hide_folder"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn diskpart, a hidden partition reports Id 27 and Type Hidden. Set the ID and assign a drive letter.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this changes partition type and needs admin rights.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>diskpart<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Select Disk _\nSelect Partition _ [1\nDetail Partition<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Detail Partition<\/code> reports:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Id = 27\nType = Hidden<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Set Id=07 Override<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Drive letter<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Diskmgmt.msc &gt; Set drive letter<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2